Going through a legal proceeding can be incredibly stressful, especially with a short window to respond. Since you are already represented by Maria Santos, she will be your best resource for navigating the specific rules of the Maricopa County civil division. 

Here is a structured list of questions you can ask your attorney to help you prepare for the next steps and figure out your evidence needs:

