Since you've just been served, the clock is ticking on your official response.
* *"What is the exact deadline to file our formal response with the court in Maricopa County?"*
* *"What specific information or documents do you need from me immediately to draft this response?"*
* *"Are there any immediate counterclaims we should be filing along with our response?"*

### 2. Gathering Evidence & Discovery
It is always better to secure evidence early before it gets lost or deleted.
* *"What specific types of evidence should I start gathering right now? (e.g., emails, text messages, financial records, signed agreements, witness contact info)"*
